"character-spine\"><div class=\"no-select\" style=\"position:absolute; bottom:-10px\"><img alt=\"Pifuxiaorendi 008.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/a/ae/Pifuxiaorendi_008.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"240\" height=\"224\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"240\" data-file-height=\"224\" /></div><div><img alt=\"Spine static-309602 xqz.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/4/4e/Spine_static-309602_xqz.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"244\" height=\"531\" class=\"img-fit mid-position\" data-file-width=\"244\" data-file-height=\"531\" /></div></div></div></div><div class=\"character-infobox\" style=\"display:block\"><div style=\"margin-bottom:20px\"><div style=\"position:relative; margin-top:5px\"><div style=\"position:absolute; top:-2px; user-select:none; pointer-events:none;\"><img alt=\"Chatacterskinviewtextbg blue.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png/233px-Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"233\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png/350px-Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png 1.5x, https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"360\" data-file-height=\"36\" /></div><div style=\"margin-left:27px;position:relative;\">崭新形象</div></div><div style=\"position:relative; margin-top:5px\"><div style=\"position:absolute; top:-2px; user-select:none; pointer-events:none;\"><img alt=\"Chatacterskinviewtextbg blue.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png/233px-Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"233\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png/350px-Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png 1.5x, https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"360\" data-file-height=\"36\" /></div><div style=\"margin-left:27px;position:relative;\">崭新单品</div></div></div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">可用角色：</span><span class=\"item-link\" data-itemid=\"3096\"><span class=\"item-link-frame\"><span class=\"item-link-rare\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%85%88%E9%A9%B1%E8%80%85\" title=\"先驱者\"><img alt=\"Bgequip3.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c6/Bgequip3.png/100px-Bgequip3.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit notpageimage\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c6/Bgequip3.png/150px-Bgequip3.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c6/Bgequip3.png/200px-Bgequip3.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a><span class=\"item-link-img\" style=\"width:60%; padding-top:7%;\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%85%88%E9%A9%B1%E8%80%85\" title=\"先驱者\"><img alt=\"先驱者\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ea/HeadIconSmall-309601.png/100px-HeadIconSmall-309601.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/e/ea/HeadIconSmall-309601.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"tooltips\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%85%88%E9%A9%B1%E8%80%85\" title=\"先驱者\">先驱者</a></span></span></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">实装版本：</span>3.2</div></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:3em\">来源：</span>活动</div></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">所属系列：</span>反时代浪潮</div></div><div><div class=\"grey-small test-hide hide-m\">编号ID：309602</div></div></div></div><h2><span id=\".E7.AA.97.E4.B8.AD.E4.BE.A7.E5.86.99_Garment_Display\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"窗中侧写_Garment_Display\">窗中侧写<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">Garment Display</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"infopad\">“长外套搭配V字领衫，这是最近的风尚，能够很好地体现出男士的风度，也很适合您。”<br />顾客看了看镜中的自己。Daedalus的深海军蓝法兰绒西装，搭配淡黄V领羊绒衫，版型流畅，剪裁合身。再挑剔的人都无法指摘什么，于是顾客微微地点了点头。<br />“帮我包起来。”<br />先驱者目送着这位顾客离开，汇入街道中的人流。服装是多变的质料，易于从躯体外侧悄悄地捏塑灵魂。他从不介意多花时间来捏出最合适的模子，它是短暂的谎言，却折射着真实的渴望。人们走进店铺，获得改变，走出店铺，套在真实的服装里，心理却武装着某种暗示。<br />而在巴黎最繁华的时尚中心，作为一名前卫的时装主理人，这是他最平常不过、一成不变的一天。</div><div id=\"崭新单品\"></div><h2><span id=\".E5.B4.AD.E6.96.B0.E5.8D.95.E5.93.81_All-new_Item\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"崭新单品_All-new_Item\">崭新单品<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">All-new Item</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"char-item-box0 tabber\"><div class=\"char-item-box1 tabber-item\" data-skinid=\"309602\"><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-309604.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/2/2d/Belonging-309604.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">风尚之手<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">The Stylish Hand</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"雨滴\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/Value-1.png/27px-Value-1.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"雨滴\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/b/bb/Value-1.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />95<hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>手感沉重的手杖，使用鎏金工艺，擎住了主理人绝对不会落俗的气质。<br />当然，除了支撑行动不便的身躯外，其也可以驱逐冒犯时尚的家伙们。幸好采访团队的大部分成员衣品尚可，而那位忙于撰稿打扮潦草的编辑就没那么幸运了。</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-309605.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/3/3c/Belonging-309605.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">领上的花体<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">The Gentleman's Sigil</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"雨滴\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/Value-1.png/27px-Value-1.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"雨滴\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/b/bb/Value-1.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />30<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到60%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>攀附在花眼上造型奇特的胸针，线条流畅如熔化的黄金一般。<br />套装如同人的封面，胸针则是他独特的签名，“希望你们以后不要成为那种随处可见的书”，受访人衷心劝告。</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-309606.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/7/76/Belonging-309606.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">裁夺时尚的标尺<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">The Measure of Fashion</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"利齿子儿\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/Value-2.png/27px-Value-2.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"利齿子儿\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/6/62/Value-2.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />300<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到100%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>以皮尺和裁缝剪为灵感的领带，尽管用料简单，但其造型绝对令人过目不忘。<br />受访人表示这很好地体现了他的理念：经典、传统，又新锐、时尚。出于对受访者笃定语气的尊重，笔者没有问出那个有关仿品总是很快占领市场的问题。</div></div></div></div></div><h2><span id=\".E8.A1.A3.E7.9D.80.E6.B5.B7.E6.8A.A5\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"衣着海报\">衣着海报</span></h2><div style=\"display:flex; gap:10px; border:1px solid #b55829; width:fit-content\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E8%82%8C%E8%82%A4%E7%9F%AB%E9%A5%B0%E7%89%A91.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"衣着 肌肤矫饰物1.jpg\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/94/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E8%82%8C%E8%82%A4%E7%9F%AB%E9%A5%B0%E7%89%A91.jpg/228px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E8%82%8C%E8%82%A4%E7%9F%AB%E9%A5%B0%E7%89%A91.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"228\" height=\"325\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/94/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E8%82%8C%E8%82%A4%E7%9F%AB%E9%A5%B0%E7%89%A91.jpg/342px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E8%82%8C%E8%82%A4%E7%9F%AB%E9%A5%B0%E7%89%A91.jpg 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/94/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E8%82%8C%E8%82%A4%E7%9F%AB%E9%A5%B0%E7%89%A91.jpg/456px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E8%82%8C%E8%82%A4%E7%9F%AB%E9%A5%B0%E7%89%A91.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"1540\" /></a><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E8%82%8C%E8%82%A4%E7%9F%AB%E9%A5%B0%E7%89%A92.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"衣着 肌肤矫饰物2.jpg\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E8%82%8C%E8%82%A4%E7%9F%AB%E9%A5%B0%E7%89%A92.jpg/228px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E8%82%8C%E8%82%A4%E7%9F%AB%E9%A5%B0%E7%89%A92.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"228\" height=\"325\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E8%82%8C%E8%82%A4%E7%9F%AB%E9%A5%B0%E7%89%A92.jpg/342px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E8%82%8C%E8%82%A4%E7%9F%AB%E9%A5%B0%E7%89%A92.jpg 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E8%82%8C%E8%82%A4%E7%9F%AB%E9%A5%B0%E7%89%A92.jpg/456px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E8%82%8C%E8%82%A4%E7%9F%AB%E9%A5%B0%E7%89%A92.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"1540\" /></a></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "衣着"}], "displaytitle": "<span style=\"display:inline-block\"><span style=\"display: flex;flex-direction: column;\">肌肤矫饰物 <small style=\"color: grey\">Idol Fascinations</small></span></span>"}}